WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.695 --> 00:00:04.128
WE NEED TO GO TO NANCY PELOSI

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:05.463
WHO IS SPEAKING RIGHT NOW.

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:09.600
&gt;&gt; THE IRANIAN ATTACK ON AN

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:12.503
AMERICAN ASSET THAT HAS ENDOWED

00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:16.040
US TO WHO MOTIVATED IT, WAS IT

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:17.775
OFFICIALLY SANCTIONED OR A ROGUE

00:00:17.776 --> 00:00:20.645
ATTACK, WHATEVER IT IS, IT WAS

00:00:20.646 --> 00:00:21.679
IRANIAN.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.849
HOWEVER WE GO FORWARD FROM HERE

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:29.687
HAS TO BE STRATEGIC AND SMART

00:00:29.688 --> 00:00:32.790
AND CLOSE IN ALLIANCE WITH OUR

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:33.124
ALLIES.

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:35.059
WE HAVE COMMON INTERESTS IN THE

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:35.393
REGION.

00:00:35.394 --> 00:00:37.729
WE KNOW THAT THE HIGH TENSION

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:38.930
WIRES ARE UP THERE.

00:00:38.931 --> 00:00:42.600
WE MUST DO EVERYTHING WE CANNOT

00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:45.303
TO ESCALATE THIS SITUATION BUT

00:00:45.304 --> 00:00:49.107
ALSO TO MAKE SURE THAT OUR

00:00:49.108 --> 00:00:50.742
PERSONNEL IN THE REGION ARE

00:00:50.743 --> 00:00:51.042
SAFE.

00:00:51.043 --> 00:00:53.411
&gt;&gt; AND YOU'RE PUSHING FOR -- IF

00:00:53.412 --> 00:00:54.612
WE WERE TO LAUNCH MILITARY

00:00:54.613 --> 00:00:55.747
ACTION --

00:00:55.748 --> 00:00:58.349
&gt;&gt; ONE THING THAT I CAN SAY -- I

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.519
WAS JUST TALKING GENERALLY.

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:05.490
IN TERMS OF -- IT WAS A MEETING

00:01:05.491 --> 00:01:07.725
IN TERMS OF WHAT WE WERE TOLD.

00:01:07.726 --> 00:01:10.795
BUT ON EVERY OCCASION THAT WE'RE

00:01:10.796 --> 00:01:12.063
ENGAGED WITH THE ADMINISTRATION

00:01:12.064 --> 00:01:15.066
IN TERMS OF OUR NATIONAL

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:17.368
SECURITY, WE MAKE IT VERY CLEAR

00:01:17.369 --> 00:01:20.405
THAT IN ORDER TO GET ENGAGED IN

00:01:20.406 --> 00:01:22.874
ANY MILITARY ACTIVE

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:24.409
ANY MILITARY ACTIITY

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:24.809
ANY MILITARY ACTIIIE

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:24.842
ANY MILITARY ACTIACE

00:01:24.843 --> 00:01:25.410
ANY MILITARY ACTIACTIVITIES, WEH

00:01:25.411 --> 00:01:25.443
ANY MILITARY ACTIACTIVITIES, WEV

00:01:25.444 --> 00:01:25.843
ANY MILITARY ACTIACTIVITIES, WEE

00:01:25.844 --> 00:01:28.112
TO HAVE A AUTHORIZATION OF

00:01:28.113 --> 00:01:32.083
MILITARY FORCE, A UMF THAT IS

00:01:32.084 --> 00:01:33.651
CLEAR IN OUR CAUCUS AND EVEN

00:01:33.652 --> 00:01:34.552
AMONG SOME REPUBLICANS.

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:35.753
I DON'T SPEAK FOR THEM.

00:01:35.754 --> 00:01:39.190
BUT ALSO WITH OUR DEMOCRATIC

00:01:39.191 --> 00:01:40.525
COLLEAGUES.

00:01:40.526 --> 00:01:42.493
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU PERSONALLY CONVINCED

00:01:42.494 --> 00:01:44.028
BASED ON THE INTELLIGENCE YOU'VE

00:01:44.029 --> 00:01:52.036
SEEN THAT THIS WAS AN IRANIAN

00:01:52.037 --> 00:01:54.138
ATTACK IN INTERNATIONAL

00:01:54.139 --> 00:01:54.839
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:55.440
&gt;&gt; [QUESTION INAUDIBLE]

00:01:55.441 --> 00:01:57.742
&gt;&gt; THEY SAID THEY WILL DO THAT.

00:01:57.743 --> 00:01:59.277
THE BRIEFING THAT WE HAD THIS

00:01:59.278 --> 00:02:00.912
MORNING IS -- FOR THE TIME THAT

00:02:00.913 --> 00:02:02.680
I WAS THERE, THEY HAD INCREASED

00:02:02.681 --> 00:02:04.081
THE NUMBER OF PEOPLE THAT WERE

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:06.050
IN THE MEETING TO BE BRIEFED.

00:02:06.051 --> 00:02:09.253
AND THEREFORE, THEY DECREASED

00:02:09.254 --> 00:02:10.988
THE LEVEL OF INFORMATION THAT

00:02:10.989 --> 00:02:11.956
THEY GAVE US.

00:02:11.957 --> 00:02:13.624
AT ONE POINT THAT I CLEARED THE

00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:14.125
ROOM.

00:02:14.126 --> 00:02:18.329
BY THEN, I HAD -- WE HAD OUR GUN

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:20.832
SAFETY EVENT THAT I HAD TO BE

00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:21.098
AT.

00:02:21.099 --> 00:02:23.301
SO I DON'T KNOW WHAT THEY GAVE

00:02:23.302 --> 00:02:24.635
AFTER I LEFT.

00:02:24.636 --> 00:02:28.105
IT WAS WELL-INTO THE BRIEFING.

00:02:28.106 --> 00:02:31.709
SO WHAT WILL THEY GIVE TO A

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:32.543
BROADER -- I DON'T KNOW HOW MUCH

00:02:32.544 --> 00:02:34.245
MORE THAN IS IN THE PUBLIC

00:02:34.246 --> 00:02:36.214
DOMAIN, BUT NONETHELESS, WE WANT

00:02:36.215 --> 00:02:40.485
TO BE CURRENT AND WE WANT THE

00:02:40.486 --> 00:02:42.220
CONFIRMATION OF IT.

00:02:42.221 --> 00:02:45.656
THAT IS OUR MEMBERS OF CONGRESS

00:02:45.657 --> 00:02:47.892
HAVE TO MAKE A DECISION AND

00:02:47.893 --> 00:02:49.093
FULLY BRIEFED ON WHAT THE

00:02:49.094 --> 00:02:50.962
PROSPECTS ARE AND WHAT THE

00:02:50.963 --> 00:02:53.464
POSSIBILITIES ARE AND WHAT THE

00:02:53.465 --> 00:02:54.532
CHOICES ARE.

00:02:54.533 --> 00:02:57.335
&gt;&gt; DO YOU AND THE ADMINISTRATION

00:02:57.336 --> 00:02:58.703
AGREE ON IRAN?

00:02:58.704 --> 00:03:01.205
&gt;&gt; THEY DIDN'T SAY YES OR NO.

00:03:01.206 --> 00:03:02.006
JUST MADE OUR STATEMENT.

00:03:02.007 --> 00:03:05.343
&gt;&gt; SO YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT THE

00:03:05.344 --> 00:03:05.743
ESCALATION.

00:03:05.744 --> 00:03:08.045
ARE YOU ADVOCATING ANY

00:03:08.046 --> 00:03:08.579
PARTICULAR ACTIONS?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.514
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:03:09.515 --> 00:03:12.717
I DON'T KNOW WHAT THE ARRAY OF

00:03:12.718 --> 00:03:14.185
OPTIONS ARE FROM THE DEPARTMENT

00:03:14.186 --> 00:03:14.652
OF DEFENSE.

00:03:14.653 --> 00:03:16.053
THE PRESIDENT KNOWS.

00:03:16.054 --> 00:03:19.957
HE DID NOT SHARE THAT WITH US.

00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:22.827
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:03:22.828 --> 00:03:26.964
&gt;&gt; [QUESTION INAUDIBLE]

00:03:26.965 --> 00:03:27.698
&gt;&gt; I HOPE THAT'S RIGHT.

00:03:27.699 --> 00:03:30.601
WE TRIED TO -- LOOK, THREE

00:03:30.602 --> 00:03:31.168
THINGS TO REMEMBER.

00:03:31.169 --> 00:03:33.604
WE MUST -- THIS IS A DANGEROUS

00:03:33.605 --> 00:03:33.971
SITUATION.

00:03:33.972 --> 00:03:36.641
WE'RE DEALING WITH A COUNTRY

00:03:36.642 --> 00:03:38.643
THAT IS A BAD ACTOR IN THE

00:03:38.644 --> 00:03:39.110
REGION.

00:03:39.111 --> 00:03:42.914
WE HAVE NO ILLUSIONS ABOUT IRAN

00:03:42.915 --> 00:03:45.816
IN TERMS OF THEIR BALLISTIC

00:03:45.817 --> 00:03:47.118
MISSILE TRANSFERS, ABOUT WHO

00:03:47.119 --> 00:03:50.154
THEY SUPPORT IN THE REGION AND

00:03:50.155 --> 00:03:50.788
THE REST.

00:03:50.789 --> 00:03:53.991
SO WE HAVE AN UNTRUSTWORTHY

00:03:53.992 --> 00:03:54.358
ADVERSARY.

00:03:54.359 --> 00:03:57.361
THE HIGH TENSION WIRES ARE UP IN

00:03:57.362 --> 00:04:00.031
THE REGION FOR A LOT OF

00:04:00.032 --> 00:04:03.234
DIFFERENT REASONS.

00:04:03.235 --> 00:04:05.403
SOME BILATERAL, SOME RELIGIOUS,

00:04:05.404 --> 00:04:05.770
WHATEVER.

00:04:05.771 --> 00:04:08.839
THE HIGH TENSION WIRES ARE UP.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.309
THIRD, WE MUST ACT IN A WAY THAT

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:14.445
DOES DEESCALATE AND DOES NOT

00:04:14.446 --> 00:04:17.315
ESCALATE THE TENSIONS AND THE

00:04:17.316 --> 00:04:20.985
SITUATION THERE.

00:04:20.986 --> 00:04:23.588
AGAIN, I COME BACK TO WHERE WE

00:04:23.589 --> 00:04:24.155
BEGIN.

00:04:24.156 --> 00:04:25.856
WE MUST BE FULLY ENGAGED WITH

00:04:25.857 --> 00:04:29.660
OUR ALLIES AS WE GO FORWARD.

00:04:29.661 --> 00:04:32.730
I'M HOPEFUL THAT YOU'RE RIGHT

00:04:32.731 --> 00:04:34.699
ABOUT WHAT SENATOR McCONNELL

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.067
SAID ABOUT WHAT THE PRESIDENT'S

00:04:36.068 --> 00:04:39.203
RESPONSE MIGHT BE, BUT I HAVE NO

00:04:39.204 --> 00:04:39.503
IDEA.

00:04:39.504 --> 00:04:43.040
THEY MAY HAVE HAD THEIR OWN

00:04:43.041 --> 00:04:44.609
CONSERVATION.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:48.045
MEASURED BY WHAT MEASURE, WE'LL

00:04:48.046 --> 00:04:48.312
SEE.

00:04:48.313 --> 00:04:49.513
&gt;&gt; YOU THINK THE WHITE HOUSE

00:04:49.514 --> 00:04:50.514
WILL CONSULT WITH CONGRESS

00:04:50.515 --> 00:04:51.515
BEFORE TAKING ANY ACTION?

00:04:51.516 --> 00:04:54.051
&gt;&gt; I CANNOT REALLY PREDICT WHAT

00:04:54.052 --> 00:04:54.785
ACTIONS THE WHITE HOUSE WILL

00:04:54.786 --> 00:04:55.319
TAKE.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.522
THEY DID CONSULT WITH US TODAY

00:04:58.523 --> 00:05:01.993
OR INFORM US OF -- WE HAD AN

00:05:01.994 --> 00:05:03.027
OPPORTUNITY TO SHARE OUR

00:05:03.028 --> 00:05:03.961
THOUGHTS WITH THE

00:05:03.962 --> 00:05:04.428
ADMINISTRATION.

00:05:04.429 --> 00:05:07.366
PRESIDENT SAID WE'LL HAVE MORE

